<title>FRANCE: Trade in Dassault suspended a third time.</title>
<headline>Trade in Dassault suspended a third time.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Dassault Aviation were suspended for a third time on Tuesday morning as an attempt to requote failed.</p>
<p>The French Stockmarkets Association SBF said Dassault was suspended limit-up with a new upper limit of 1,137 and a lower level of 1,083. It closed at 1,230 francs on Friday and was suspended limit-down all day on Monday.</p>
<p>A new attempt at requoting will be at 0930 GMT.</p>
</text>
